8  blockbuster ready player one  an m41 a posh wife would also go on to  influence firearm design in a slew of  video games in the virtual world we can  see the influence of the pulse rifle in  the blocky handles thicker lower barrels  and digital ammo counters of many of the  weapons used in modern video games you  only have to look as far as the human  arms and the Halo series to see where  the inspiration comes from or toward the  STA 52 from Killzone or The Vindicator  and mattock variants of Mass Effect  rifles to see the weapon design that  also taps into the same aesthetic that  made the pulse rifles so iconic even in  the real world in the 1990s the US Army  was looking for their new weapon and  surprisingly the universe of aliens was  brought up as an inspiration the  objective individual combat weapons  program was founded to create the next  generation in personal small-arms for  the US military the XM 2900 icw featured  advanced targeting as well as its own  micro grenade launcher similar to that  of the m41 a pulse rifle and before you  believe the similarities to be pure  coincidence during the development phase  the team actually stated they wanted the  weapon to look more sci-fi and  reportedly even use the Starship  Troopers morita rifle as well as the m4  1a as sources of inspiration I think the  other thing about the pulse rifle is the  sort of combination weapon thing any  weapon especially a gun that has an  alter an alt mode and alt fire is just  intrinsically more fun to watch or to  play it's got the the counter counting  down on the side which is just total  nonsense for a practical point of view  and that's purely cinematic that's only  there for the viewer to enjoy and of  course we've seen that paralleled in in  videogames umpteen times and there's  something about the the silhouette of it  as well that that shroud the shape of  that shroud is just it almost like  lightning in a bottle for a sci-fi  weapon for me decades later we are still  seeing elements of the m41 a pulse rifle  in our favorite movies and games that  all evokes similar feelings of awe and  intrigue that I personally had when I  saw the pulse rifle for the very first  time and while many will pay tribute or  iterate on this grenade launching  granddaddy of science fiction there is  one thing that is certain that for the  USMC sm4 one a pulse rifle it's far from  game over man game over  thank you so much for joining us on this  deep dive into an 80s sci-fi icon for  more videos just like this one be sure  to subscribe and you won't miss our next  week's episode of loadout

